# The Catppuccin theme.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente-catppuccin.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/tema-catppuccin.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --theme catppuccin --demo vetrina ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/tema-catppuccin.png"
Sleep 1s
